prune .claude
prune .git
prune .github
prune .superpowers
prune .worktrees
prune archive
prune build
prune dist
prune downloads
prune Final/docs
prune Final/downloads
prune mcps
prune test_out
global-exclude *.log
global-exclude *.py[cod]
